---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Documentation - urfired.lol"
  description="Learn how to use the urfired.lol API to generate personalized firing messages."
>
  <div class="docs-container">
    <div class="docs-content">
      <header class="docs-header">
        <h1>Documentation</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Learn how to use urfired.lol to spread the joy of getting fired</p>
      </header>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>What is urfired.lol?</h2>
        <p>
          urfired.lol is a humorous web application that generates random, satirical reasons 
          why someone might be fired. Perfect for sharing with friends, pranking coworkers, 
          or just having a laugh during tough times.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>How to Use</h2>
        <p>
          Simply visit the homepage and press <strong>space</strong> or <strong>click anywhere</strong> 
          to generate a new firing reason. It's that simple!
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>URL Parameters</h2>
        <p class="intro-text">
          Personalize the firing experience by adding URL parameters. Both parameters are optional 
          and have a maximum length of 10 characters.
        </p>

        <div class="parameter">
          <div class="param-header">
            <code class="param-name">n</code>
            <span class="param-type">Name Parameter</span>
          </div>
          <p class="param-description">
            Add a name to personalize the message. The name will be converted to uppercase.
          </p>
          <div class="example">
            <strong>Example:</strong>
            <code class="code-block">https://urfired.lol/?n=John</code>
            <a href="/?n=John" class="demo-link" target="_blank">Try it →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="parameter">
          <div class="param-header">
            <code class="param-name">c</code>
            <span class="param-type">Company Parameter</span>
          </div>
          <p class="param-description">
            Add a company name to make it more realistic. The company name will be converted to uppercase.
          </p>
          <div class="example">
            <strong>Example:</strong>
            <code class="code-block">https://urfired.lol/?c=Google</code>
            <a href="/?c=Google" class="demo-link" target="_blank">Try it →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="parameter">
          <div class="param-header">
            <code class="param-name">n + c</code>
            <span class="param-type">Combined Parameters</span>
          </div>
          <p class="param-description">
            Combine both parameters for maximum personalization and hilarity.
          </p>
          <div class="example">
            <strong>Example:</strong>
            <code class="code-block">https://urfired.lol/?n=Sarah&c=Meta</code>
            <a href="/?n=Sarah&c=Meta" class="demo-link" target="_blank">Try it →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Use Cases</h2>
        <ul class="use-cases">
          <li>📧 Send a personalized firing message to your friends</li>
          <li>💼 Share during corporate restructuring announcements (too soon?)</li>
          <li>🎭 Create memes and social media content</li>
          <li>😂 Lighten the mood during actual layoff season</li>
          <li>🎉 Generate unique messages for team building (or team breaking)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="section technical">
        <h2>Technical Details</h2>
        <ul class="tech-list">
          <li><strong>Built with:</strong> Astro 5.x</li>
          <li><strong>Deployed on:</strong> Cloudflare Pages</li>
          <li><strong>Response time:</strong> Blazing fast ⚡</li>
          <li><strong>Database:</strong> None (stateless, just like your employment)</li>
          <li><strong>Character limit:</strong> 10 characters per parameter</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <footer class="footer">
        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a href="/">← Home</a>
          <span class="separator">•</span>
          <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>
          <span class="separator">•</span>
          <a href="https://github.com/yorjaggy/urfired.lol" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
          <span class="separator">•</span>
          <a href="https://ko-fi.com/yorjaggy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">☕ Ko-fi</a>
        </nav>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .docs-container {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background-color: #FF5722;
    padding: 32px 16px;
  }

  .docs-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 48px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .docs-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #FF5722;
  }

  .docs-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #666;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #000;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .intro-text {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .parameter {
    background-color: #f8f9fa;
    border-left: 4px solid #FF5722;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .param-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .param-name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    background-color: #FF5722;
    color: white;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .param-type {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #666;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .param-description {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #555;
  }

  .example {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .example strong {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #666;
  }

  .code-block {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    background-color: #2d2d2d;
    color: #50fa7b;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: inline-block;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .demo-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #FF5722;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .demo-link:hover {
    color: #E64A19;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .use-cases {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .use-cases li {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #333;
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
  }

  .use-cases li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .technical {
    background-color: #f8f9fa;
    padding: 24px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .tech-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .tech-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #333;
    padding: 6px 0;
  }

  .tech-list strong {
    color: #FF5722;
  }

  .docs-footer {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 2px solid #eee;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #FF5722;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: #E64A19;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .separator {
    color: #ccc;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .docs-content {
      padding: 32px 24px;
    }

    .docs-header h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .section h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .code-block {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    .example {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .docs-container {
      padding: 16px 8px;
    }

    .docs-content {
      padding: 24px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .param-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 6px;
    }
  }
</style>
